      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just stress tho. its like... the core code is just bad. i keep trying to run the same programs, trying to live like everyone else, but the hardware is just failing. the fan is spinning so fast but the system is just overheating and freezing over and over. it feels like the errors are getting deeper into the kernel. there's no amount of \"small steps\" that can fix a hardware failure. once the base architecture is corrupted, nothing else is gonna run right. it just feels like a waste of resources to keep trying to boot up.",
